WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.001 --> 00:00:03.336
You know I’m a big dreamer. 

00:00:04.379 --> 00:00:06.506
That’s why I tell kids,
you got to dream it,

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:08.049
before you can become it. 

00:00:08.633 --> 00:00:11.094
Leticia Bufoni wins the gold!

00:00:11.553 --> 00:00:12.178
Dream.

00:00:18.059 --> 00:00:19.561
When you want to win
something so bad,

00:00:19.602 --> 00:00:21.396
you're ready to go,
you're amped up.

00:00:23.189 --> 00:00:25.400
When more is on the line,
it's important that you perform.

00:00:26.234 --> 00:00:27.318
I know who I am.

00:00:27.444 --> 00:00:28.653
This is what I am.

00:00:28.653 --> 00:00:30.113
The best player in the world.

00:00:33.241 --> 00:00:34.200
Nobody outworked me
in the neighborhood.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.452
I wanted it more.

00:00:37.328 --> 00:00:38.288
This is my way of leading.

00:00:38.288 --> 00:00:39.372
This is beyond basketball.

00:00:41.499 --> 00:00:43.501
I just put every bit of 
who I am into surfing. 

00:00:45.211 --> 00:00:45.837
Greatness isn't perfection.

00:00:45.837 --> 00:00:47.714
Greatness is the ability
to overcome.

00:00:47.714 --> 00:00:48.590
No matter what.

00:00:51.801 --> 00:00:52.510
(Cheering)

00:00:57.307 --> 00:01:00.477
As soon as we step on the
field, the feelings have to go.

00:01:03.313 --> 00:01:04.773
Adversity is only temporary.

00:01:10.653 --> 00:01:11.571
Showtime.

